text If is a node, then for each CSS text box produced by , in content order, compute the text of the box after application of the CSS processing rules and rules, set to the of the resulting strings, and return . The CSS processing rules are slightly modified: collapsible spaces at the end of lines are always collapsed, but they are only removed if the line is the last line of the block, or it ends with a element. Soft hyphens should be preserved. @17,140526,694,102
